2 CONC .  IT is assumed that the family resided in the Philadelphia area (their port city) until about 1760.  In 1770, Lawrence&apos;s name, as well as the names of Daniel, NIcholas, and Johan Nicholas, were found on the rolls of the Great Conewago Church
