1 NOTE One record says her given name was Wilhelmina. She had a brother Johann Fenske who died in 1815 during the Napoleonic War. Possibly died in Friedensruh, S Russia as her daughter was married there later that year and Peter Funk lived there with hi
2 CONC s second wife. Joined Gnadenfeld Mennonite Church at about age 19. Gnadenfeld Mennonite Church at about age 19. Note from John F Duerksen also says this was after she was married and she was born in Prussia.
2 CONT Her grandson John F. Duerksen (1863-1932) wrote in his Bible&apos;s family history page, &quot;My grandmother was about 19 years old when she left the Lutheran Church and joined the Gnadenfeld Mennonite Church&quot;.
