2 NOTE He fled Germany as a young single man with his widowed mother during the mass Protestant exodus, arriving in New York Colony in the great Palatine migration wave of 1710.
1 MARR
2 NOTE He married Anna Maria Zeller in the Schoharie Valley. His 1771 will (probated in Albany after his death in 1777) explicitly names his son Johannes Adam (1724́�“1801), providing the definitive documentary link down your tree.
