2 NOTE Peter Haun died in 1815, Scott County. His intestate records indicate children John (1783-1833) wife Catherine Winter, Henry wife Sarah, Adam (1785-1845) wife Charlotte, Elizabeth Proctor (Benjamin), Margaret Hedger (Zachariah) and  Mary Towsley.
