3 WWW https://www.ancestry.com/media/viewer/viewer/6ef6624e-d41d-4467-be68-aca6cd1d9d11/52881559/13422619857?_phsrc=hxx62&usePUBJs=true
1 NOTE Mike Dirksen merged this person with GM#311182, the Katharina Adrian whose family migrated from Prussia in 1819 with Elder Goertz&apos; congregation. Visas issued 19 June 1819. Page 117, 140 and 167 of Mennonite Migration to Russia 1788-1828 - Remp
2 CONC el. This same group included the Dircks(ens), and Funks who settled two adjacent farms (#11 and #12) in Alexanderthal 1820.
2 CONT    
2 CONT Her son Jacob J. Duerksen wrote that she died 6 Mar 1869 having lived 57 years, 4 months and 4 days. That would make her birth date 2 Nov 1811. No other records support that date. The AHSGR genealogy file card for her husband shows her birth date t
2 CONC o be Sep 1805. Of the three I trust the church birth record most.
